'   a fresh rim is brighter than the ground it sits in, and the newest of them',
'   throw rays out several radii past the ejecta blanket. Only the widest and',
'   youngest craters get them, which is why this costs an angle per cell and the',
'   finer layers do not. */',
'vec2 craterTop(vec2 p, vec2 period, float cl, float seed){',
'  vec2 i = floor(p), f = fract(p);',
